          "text": "ከመሄድ ፡ ተገታች ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወተሰብረት ፡ ወተመትረት ፡ ገቦሃ ፡ ዘድኅር ፡ እም",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ገድ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከማዕበሉ ፡ ጽናት ፡ የተነሣ ፡ በስተክበ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሮ ፡ ቤት ፡ በኩል ፡ ተሰበረች ። ዘድኅፀ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እምገድ ፡ ይላል ፡ ማዕበሉ ፡ በከረከረበት ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በኩል ፡ ተሰበረች ።-",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወእምቅድሜሃሰ ፡ ኢክህሉ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከወደ፡ ፊቷ፡ግን፡ቀዛፎች፡ ሊገቷት፡ አልተ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቻላቸውም ። አንድም ፡ ድንጊያዎች ፡ ሊገ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ቷት ፡ አልተቻላቸውም ፡ ሐተታ ፡ መር",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከብ ፡ ከወደ ፡ ፊት ፡ ያሞጠሞጠ ፡ ነው ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከወደ ፡ ኋላ ፡ ሰፋ ፡ ያለ ፡ ነውና ፡ ፪ ፡ ቆሮ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፲፩ ፡ ፳፭ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": "፵፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፵፪ ፤ ⟪ወተማክሩ ፡ ሠገራት ፡ ከመ ፡ ይቅትሉ ፡ ሙቁ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሓነ ፡ ከመ ፡ ኢይጽብቱ ፡ ወኢያምሥጡ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዋኝተው ፡ እንዳያመልጡ ፡ እሥረኞችን ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ይገሏቸው ፡ ዘንድ ፡ ጭፍሮች ፡ መከሩ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "chapter_title",
          "text": "ምዕራፍ ፡ ፳፰ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": "፩",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፩ ፤ ⟪ወእምድኅረዝ ፡ አእመርነ ፡ ከመ ፡ ይእቲ ፡ ደ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሴት ፡ ትሰመይ ፡ መላጥያ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ኢፈለጡ ፡ ኖትያት ፡ ብሔሮ ፡ ብሎ ፡ ነበ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ርና ፡ ከዚህ ፡ በኋላ ፡ ያች ፡ ደሴት ፡ መላ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጥያ ፡ እንድትባል ፡ አወቅነ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": "፪",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፪ ፤ ⟪ወመሐሩነ ፡ አረሚ ፡ እለ ፡ ይነብሩ ፡ ህየ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በዚያ ፡ የሚኖሩ ፡ አረማውያንም ፡ አዘኑ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ልን ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአሠነዩ ፡ ላዕሌነ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "በጎ ፡ ሥራ ፡ ሠሩልን ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 31,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአንደዱ ፡ እሳተ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 32,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሥራውን ፡ አመጣው ፡ እሳት ፡ አንድደው፤",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 2,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": "፵፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፵፫ ፤ ⟪ወከልኦሙ ፡ ሐቢ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሹሙ ፡ ግን ፡ ከለከላቸው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 3,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪እስመ ፡ ፈቀደ ፡ ያድኅኖ ፡ ለጳውሎስ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 4,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጳውሎስን ፡ ሊያድነው ፡ ወዷልና ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 5,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወለእለ ፡ የአምሩ ፡ ጸቢተ ፡ አዘዞሙ ፡ ይጽብቱ ፡ ወይ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 6,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ፃኡ ፡ ለሐይቅ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 7,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዋና ፡ የሚያውቁትንም ፡ ዋኝተው ፡ ይወ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 8,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጡ ፡ ዘንድ ፡ አዘዛቸው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 9,
          "margin_tag": "፵፬",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፵፬ ፤ ⟪ወእለ ፡ ተርፉ ፡ ዐደዉ ፡ ላዕለ ፡ ዕፀ ፡ ሐመር ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 10,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወሰላድዉ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 11,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የቀሩትም ፡ በመርከቡ ፡ ስባሪ ፡ በሰሌ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 12,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዳው ፡ እየሆኑ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 13,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወካልኣን ፡ ዐደዉ ፡ በአሕባለ ፡ ሐመር ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 14,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እኩሌቶቹም ፡ የመርከቡን ፡ ገመድ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 15,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እየያዙ ፡ ተሻገሩ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 16,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወወፅኡ ፡ ኵሎሙ ፡ ወበጽሑ ፡ ምድረ ፡ በዘከመ ፡ ዝ ፡ ግብር ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 17,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "እንዲህ ፡ ባለ ፡ ነገር ፡ ወጥተው ፡ ከወ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 18,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ደቡ ፡ ደረሱ ፡ ቍ ፡ ፳፬-፳፭ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 19,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወአስተጋብኡነ ፡ ለኵልነ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 20,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ሁላችንንም ፡ ሰብስበው ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 21,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ከመ ፡ ንስሐን ፡ እምጽንዓተ ፡ ቍር ፡ ወእምብዝኅተ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 22,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ዝናም ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 23,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከዝናሙ ፡ ብዛት ፡ ከብርዱ ፡ ጽናት ፡ የተ",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": true
        },
        {
          "line_num": 24,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ነሣ ፡ ሙቁ ፡ አሉን ፡ ፪ ፡ ቆሮ፡ ፲፩ ፡ ፳፯ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 25,
          "margin_tag": "፫",
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "፫ ፤ ⟪ወአስተጋብአ ፡ ጳውሎስ ፡ ብዙኀ ፡ ሐሠረ ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 26,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ወወገረ ፡ ላዕለ ፡ እሳት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 27,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ጳውሎስም፡ ለትሩፋት፡ አያርፍምና፡ ብዙ፡",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 28,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ግፋፎ ፡ አጋፎ ፡ ከእሳቱ ፡ ላይ ፡ ጨመረ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 29,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወወፅአት ፡ አፍዖት ፡ እምላሀበ ፡ እሳት ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 30,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "ከእሳቱ ፡ ላንቃ ፡ እፍኝት ፡ ወጥታ ።",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "column_index": 3,
      "lines": [
        {
          "line_num": 1,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "⟪ወነሰከቶ ፡ እዴሁ ፡ ለጳውሎስ ፡⟫",
          "word_wraps_to_next_line": false
        },
        {
          "line_num": 2,
          "margin_tag": null,
          "line_type": "body",
          "text": "የጳውሎስን ፡ እጁን ፡ ነደፈችው ።",
